From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arsslen Idadi <arsslens021@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:09:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/20] focaltech_moh: add a test recorded on 2808:93a9

A capture on a real 2808:93a9, made with the back of a hand, which has no
friction ridges, so that the recording holds no fingerprint. It replays the
old SIU bridge's whole capture: open and wake, the polling, the wake
requests the driver sends while the sensor stays in deep sleep, and the
frame read, compared with the image the recording kept.
---
